flowchart LR
    Input[briefly input] --> Resolver{Input Type?}
    Resolver -->|text/file| Extract[Text Extractor]
    Resolver -->|URL| Trafilatura[Trafilatura]
    Resolver -->|PDF| PDFPlumber[pdfplumber]
    Resolver -->|YouTube| YT{Captions?}
    YT -->|yes| InnerTube[InnerTube API]
    YT -->|no| Whisper[yt-dlp + Groq Whisper]
    Extract --> Cache[(SQLite Cache)]
    Trafilatura --> Cache
    PDFPlumber --> Cache
    InnerTube --> Cache
    Whisper --> Cache
    Cache --> LLM[LiteLLM + Brief Type]
    LLM --> Output[Brief]
